ous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/06/road-pirates-assemble-desert-snow-is.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4545592844368455748' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4545592844368455748' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-591565786"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 13, 2015 at 10:42 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-489068426707974483</id><published>2015-07-01T09:30:10.133-06:00</published><updated>2015-07-01T09:30:10.133-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;However all the dogs need to have records of...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;However all the dogs need to have records of every time they are brought out and it needs to be backed up with a video showing the dog and its hit.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Wishful thinking. The true solution is to eliminate the drug war; then the dogs become irrelevant.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyway, google &amp;quot;Clever Hans&amp;quot;. Try not to put so much faith in dogs or in government.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The whole thing is a scam to put a veneer of respectability on theft and looting, which is the main program of the state. A legislature creating a tax is in no way different from a Desert Snow &amp;quot;graduate&amp;quot; grabbing some cash he finds.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4545592844368455748/comments/default/489068426707974483'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4545592844368455748/comments/default/489068426707974483'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedomi